 web or wall thickness should as a minimum be 0.10\" - Aluminum, .13 Magnesium and .13 for Steel.","note":"derived: 0.13 in × 25.4 mm/in"}},{"id":"sand-casting.draftMinDeg","process":"sand-casting","key":"draftMinDeg","value":1,"unit":"deg","description":"the least draft, external and internal","source":"A public web page, read only, its value as printed there: each value names its page (URL), the date read and the page's own label (the value's `page`); converted from inches where the page gives both, the page's millimetres kept","page":{"url":"https://www.engineersedge.com/sand_cast.htm","read":"2026-10-21","label":"Standard draft for sand casting is 2 degrees with a minimum of about 1 degree for external and internal features."}},{"id":"sand-casting.draftRecDeg","process":"sand-casting","key":"draftRecDeg","value":2,"unit":"deg","description":"the standard draft","source":"A public web page, read only, its value as printed there: each value names its page (URL), the date read and the page's own label (the value's `page`); converted from inches where the page gives both, the page's millimetres kept","page":{"url":"https://www.engineersedge.com/sand_cast.htm","read":"2026-10-21","label":"Standard draft for sand casting is 2 degrees with a minimum of about 1 degree for external and internal features."}},{"id":"sand-casting.sectionRatioMax","process":"sand-casting","key":"sectionRatioMax","value":2,"unit":"ratio","description":"a section change’s thickness ratio, at most, without a wedge between","source":"A public web page, read only, its value as printed there: each value names its page (URL), the date read and the page's own label (the value's `page`); converted from inches where the page gives both, the page's millimetres kept","page":{"url":"https://www.engineersedge.com/sand_cast.htm","read":"2026-10-21","label":"If a section change of over 2:1 thickness ratio is unavoidable … use a wedge form between the unequal sections."}},{"id":"sand-casting.shrink.iron","pr